Code: MIT License
  Applies to: tools/ (build and reference scripts). The text is in LICENSE-CODE.
  SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

The figures in the packs are facts published by governments and agencies; each parameter names its
source. This licence covers the selection, structure, rules and test suites in this repository, not
the underlying official publications. The packs are provided as is, with no warranty, as estimates
for comparing jobs rather than payroll or tax advice.
